{"id":28497,"slug":"speedy","title":"Speedy","year":1928,"country":"United States","duration":86,"spine":788,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28497-speedy","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/d4ef2e7dbb5595833ea955a9afa3d116/VYObudgVtJqNJ8BCld9NP8ayYfEPqj_large.jpg","description":"Speedy was the last silent feature to star Harold Lloyd—and one of his very best. The slapstick legend reprises his “Glasses Character,” this time as a good-natured but scatterbrained New Yorker who can’t keep a job. He finally finds his true calling when he becomes determined to help save the city’s last horse-drawn streetcar, which is operated by his sweetheart’s crusty grandfather. From its joyous visit to Coney Island to its incredible Babe Ruth cameo to its hair-raising climactic stunts on the city’s streets, Speedy is an out-of-control love letter to New York that will have you grinning from ear to ear.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Ted Wilde","slug":"ted-wilde"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Harold Lloyd","role":"Harold “Speedy” Swift","slug":"harold-lloyd"},{"actor":"Ann Christy","role":"Jane Dillon","slug":"ann-christy"},{"actor":"Bert Woodruff","role":"Pop Dillon","slug":"bert-woodruff"},{"actor":"Babe Ruth","role":"Himself","slug":"babe-ruth"},{"actor":"Byron Douglas","role":"W. S. Wilton","slug":"byron-douglas"},{"actor":"Brooks Benedict","role":"Steve Carter","slug":"brooks-benedict"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Ted Wilde","slug":"ted-wilde"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Harold Lloyd Corporation","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"William R. Fraser, general manager","slug":null},{"role":"Story and scenario by","person":"John Grey","slug":null},{"role":"Story and scenario by","person":"Lex Neal","slug":null},{"role":"Story and scenario by","person":"Howard Rogers","slug":null},{"role":"Story and scenario by","person":"Jay Howe","slug":null},{"role":"Photography","person":"Walter Lundin","slug":null},{"role":"Titles b